Proclamations
14. Consideration of a resolution proclaiming Sept 16, 2025 as Laramie
County Voter Registration Day.
25 - 398
Resolution Proclaiming Sept 16 as Voter Registration
Day
Attachments:
Mikayla Portz, County Clerk Elections, read the resolution into the record. She spoke
about an event at the Laramie County Library on Sept 16, 2025, where citizens can
learn about the election process, register to vote, or check their registration status.
She also noted there will be a mock election.
A motion was made by Commissioner Hollingshead, seconded by
Commissioner Heath, that this agenda item be approved. The motion
carried by the following vote:
Malm, Heath, Hollingshead, Zwonitzer
Aye:
Thompson
Excused:
Grants
