17. PUBLIC HEARING regarding a vacation of Cowboy Brew, 1st Filing,
Tract 2, and BT II First Subdivision, Lot 2, Block 1, administrative plat
known as BT II First Subdivision, 2nd Filing, Laramie County, WY.
25 - 400
BT II, LLC, Vacation and Administrative Plat, BT II First
Subdivision, 2nd Filing
BT II, LLC, Vacation and Administrative Plat, BT II First
Subdivision, 2nd Filing, Revised
Attachments:
Justin Arnold, Planning, said DeRoon Consulting, LLC, on behalf of the landowner, BT
II, LLC, submitted an application for an administrative plat. He said the application is
to replat the existing two parcels, totaling 4.7 acres, into a new plat to be known as BT
II First Subdivision, 2nd Filing, with the use being for BT Campground.
Arnold said based on evidence provided, staff recommends approval of the vacation
and the administrative plat with the adoption of findings of fact a and b.
Chairman Malm opened the hearing for PUBLIC COMMENT. Hearing no PUBLIC
COMMENT, Chairman Malm closed the hearing.
A motion was made by Commissioner Hollingshead, seconded by
Commissioner Zwonitzer, to approve the vacation of Cowboy Brew, 1st
Filing, Tract 2, and BT II First Subdivision, Lot 2, Block 1, and approve the
administrative plat, BT II First Subdivision, 2nd Filing, Laramie County,
WY, and adopt the findings of fact a and b of the staff report with no
conditions. The motion carried by the following vote:
Malm, Heath, Hollingshead, Zwonitzer
Aye:
